  "notes": [
    "One semitone equals one fret; an octave equals twelve frets.",
    "Ionian is the major scale; Aeolian is natural minor. They are not counted again.",
    "Classical melodic minor often descends as natural minor; jazz melodic minor uses the same collection both ways.",
    "A mode is defined by its tonal centre and harmony, not merely a fingering starting on another note.",
    "A formula is a pitch collection, not a rule to play every note over every chord."
